{"parentUuid":"1a0c16e1-108c-46e0-acd0-24ebcc187e0d","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"e4eec46c-71ba-49bc-9c29-ae4f56a40e97","agentId":"a3f5ff65abb3f99fa","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01BgJsAxn7gFs5M7MdsU1svC","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t{\"parentUuid\":null,\"isSidechain\":true,\"promptId\":\"ac68b9dc-9847-4e6f-8ec2-6b4367414408\",\"agentId\":\"a9d8ba25a087fb653\",\"type\":\"user\",\"message\":{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"深度调研终末地（Endfield）玩家社区的高级工厂布局技巧 + 人类专家 know-how，看有什么\\\"非显性\\\"经验可以转成模型约束或 ordering 启发式。\\n\\n**背景：** Round 6 曾调研游戏特性，但偏官方资料。这次深挖玩家级 know-how：B 站、贴吧、Reddit、Discord、Wiki 上的\\\"老司机布局\\\"。\\n\\n**调研重点（≤800 字）：**\\n1. 终末地\\\"中容武陵电池产线\\\"等知名 blueprint 设计哲学\\n2. 玩家共识的\\\"必避坑\\\"配置\\n3. 端口走向 / 流量布线 / 动力杆放置的高频模式\\n4. 知名玩家攻略博主\\n5. 跟我们 70×70 + 326 设施约束的对应\\n6. 有什么是 canonical_rules 没编码但玩家共识必然成立的\\n\\n输出末尾：\\\"有 1-3 条可以转 hint 或 nogood 的\\\"\"},\"uuid\":\"9b49f9a8-9579-4b93-9c0e-1aea5ebbeeca\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-05-07T22:10:25.340Z\",\"userType\":\"external\",\"entrypoint\":\"cli\",\"cwd\":\"D:\\\\claude pj\\\\zmd\\\\.upstream_clones\",\"sessionId\":\"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9\",\"version\":\"2.1.128\",\"gitBranch\":\"master\",\"slug\":\"squishy-zooming-sphinx\"}\n2\t{\"parentUuid\":\"9b49f9a8-9579-4b93-9c0e-1aea5ebbeeca\",\"isSidechain\":true,\"agentId\":\"a9d8ba25a087fb653\",\"attachment\":{\"type\":\"deferred_tools_delta\",\"addedNames\":[\"EnterWorktree\",\"ExitWorktree\",\"Monitor\",\"NotebookEdit\",\"TaskStop\",\"WebFetch\",\"WebSearch\"],\"addedLines\":[\"EnterWorktree\",\"ExitWorktree\",\"Monitor\",\"NotebookEdit\",\"TaskStop\",\"WebFetch\",\"WebSearch\"],\"removedNames\":[],\"readdedNames\":[]},\"type\":\"attachment\",\"uuid\":\"dabb27d4-2e14-4059-9410-462e58d3ede0\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-05-07T22:10:25.342Z\",\"userType\":\"external\",\"entrypoint\":\"cli\",\"cwd\":\"D:\\\\claude pj\\\\zmd\\\\.upstream_clones\",\"sessionId\":\"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9\",\"version\":\"2.1.128\"