{"parentUuid":"20c29d05-eb5e-41e5-a35d-dd2ae0b0be57","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"a3f5ff65abb3f99fa","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_01JwB568wiaPNJF9FeLR51gW","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_015sq1fwsVvYgLPQemRQDjvz","name":"Grep","input":{"pattern":"bridge|elevated|l1_","path":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd\\src\\models\\routing_subproblem.py","output_mode":"content","-n":true,"head_limit":30},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":771,"cache_read_input_tokens":66036,"output_tokens":242,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":771},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":242,"cache_read_input_tokens":66036,"cache_creation_input_tokens":771,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":771,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"}},"requestId":"req_011CapGSptxVkvRpnEw6fqJZ","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"1da2b15f-248d-49c9-917a-2ac9398fb230","timestamp":"2026-05-08T01:53:38.551Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"1da2b15f-248d-49c9-917a-2ac9398fb230","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"c60c5a75-01bd-42f0-a730-12d2dc1169d6","agentId":"a3f5ff65abb3f99fa","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_015sq1fwsVvYgLPQemRQDjvz","type":"tool_result","content":"532:    \"\"\"CP-SAT routing model with belt / splitter / merger / bridge states.\"\"\"\n560:        self._l1_vars: Dict[Tuple[int, int], List[Any]] = defaultdict(list)\n638:        self._add_bridge_constraints()\n675:                    \"component_type\": \"bridge\",\n784:                            self._l1_vars[(x, y)].append(var)\n814:            \"elevated_bridge_states\": int(state_counter.get((ELEVATED_LAYER, \"bridge\"), 0)),\n833:    def _add_bridge_constraints(self):\n834:        for cell, l1_vars in self._l1_vars.items():\n835:            if not l1_vars:\n841:            l1_any = self.model.NewBoolVar(f\"l1_any_{x}_{y}\")\n842:            self.model.AddMaxEquality(l1_any, l1_vars)\n844:                self.model.AddImplication(l1_any, var.Not())"}]},"uuid":"964d9d25-f78d-4d68-962e-e16806569466","timestamp":"2026-05-08T01:53:38.606Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"1da2b15f-248d-49c9-917a-2ac9398fb230","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"964d9d25-f78d-4d68-962e-e16806569466","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"a3f5ff65abb3f99fa","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_01Kjh2gfcyw4PvjKcXtDBEGo","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Confirmed: bridges are at layer=1 (`ELEVATED_LAYER`), and `_l1_vars[(x, y)]` enumerates all bridge bool vars per cell. Total bridge count = sum over all `r_vars` where `layer == ELEVATED_LAYER`. Per-commodity bridge count = sum over `flow_in/flow_out` patterns at layer 1 for that commodity.\n\nNow I have all verification data. Let me draft the blueprint.\n\n---\n\n# P1 #9 实施蓝图：3 条玩家 hint → CP-SAT patch\n\n## R10 三条 hint 来源（transcript 末尾原文摘录）\n\n1. \"**bridge_hop_le_2** ordering hint — 端口对最大物流桥跳数 ≤ 2 高 hint 优先级\"\n2. \"**storage_box_overload_separation** nogood — 同箱不混 高产+低需 vs 低产+高需\"\n3. \"**compact_block_aspect_prior** ordering — 接近正方形+高密度优先\"\n\n## API verification（已实测）\n\n- `cp_model.CpModel.add_hint(var, value)`: 实测可用，对 BoolVar 接受 value=0/1（`python -c` 验证通过）\n- `add_bool_or(*literals)`: 接受 `var.Not()` literals，可写 nogood（实测通过）\n- `AddDecisionStrategy([vars], CHOOSE_FIRST, SELECT_MAX_VALUE)`: binding_subproblem 已用 (binding_subproblem.py:390-394) — 已知形式，安全\n- `add_hint` 对 IntVar 和 BoolVar 都支持（doc: \"Adds 'var == value' as a hint to the solver\"）— 但**不是硬约束**，solver 可违反\n\n---\n\n## Hint 1 — `bridge_hop_le_2` (ordering / hint)\n\n**数学语义**: 全图 elevated bridge cell 总数尽量少（≤2 是最优区，>2 是延迟区）。\n\n**实施位置**: `src/models/routing_subproblem.py` 新增 `_add_bridge_count_hint()`，在 `build()` 末尾、`solve()` 之前 hook。\n\n**CP-SAT 形式**（**hint，不是约束**）:\n\n```python\ndef _add_bridge_count_hint(self) -> None:\n    # 对所有 elevated layer 的 r_var 给 hint=0（首选不用 bridge）。\n    # solver 仍可在必须时翻成 1。\n    for (x, y, layer, _fi, _fo, _c), var in self.r_vars.items():\n        if layer == ELEVATED_LAYER:\n            self.model.add_hint(var, 0)\n```\n\n**可选加强**（仍是 hint，更直接表达\"≤2\"）：用 IntVar 聚合 + add_hint：\n\n```python\nall_l1_vars = [v for vs in self._l1_vars.values() for v in vs]\nif all_l1_vars:\n    bridge_count = self.model.NewIntVar(0, len(all_l1_vars), \"bridge_count_hint\")\n    self.model.Add(bridge_count == sum(all_l1_vars))\n    self.model.add_hint(bridge_count, 0)  # solver 偏向 0，超过 2 仍合法\n```\n\n**风险**: SAFE。`add_hint` 在 ortools 9.15 是 first-class API，hint 错误不会破坏正确性（solver 自动放弃错误 hint）。**对 max_lex(area, min_side) 影响 = 0**（不影响 area/min_side 主目标，只改 routing 子问题搜索方向；routing 是可行性判定，不参与目标函数）。**预期对 wall-time 影响 = 轻度负**（更快命中可行解 → 子问题缩短）。\n\n**工时**: 30 分钟（写 + 单测 + 跑 1 轮 routing 回归）。\n\n---\n\n## Hint 2 — `storage_box_overload_separation` (soft nogood)\n\n**数学语义**: 对每个 `protocol_storage_box` 实例的输入槽集合 S，禁止 S 同时包含 commodity A（高产/低需，`net_flow > 0` 且 `demand < production`）和 commodity B（低产/高需，`net_flow < 0` 且 `production < demand`）。\"高/低\"按 net_flow 分两组。\n\n**数据流（从已验证的 schema 计算分类）**:\n\n- 每个 commodity c 的产出率 = Σ over recipes r where c ∈ r.outputs of `r.outputs[c]/r.ticks_per_cycle × instance_count(r.template)`\n- 消费率 = Σ over recipes r where c ∈ r.inputs of `r.inputs[c]/r.ticks_per_cycle × instance_count(r.template)`\n- net_flow(c) = production - consumption\n- 分组: `HIGH_PROD_LOW_DEMAND = {c: net_flow > +threshold}`, `LOW_PROD_HIGH_DEMAND = {c: net_flow < -threshold}`\n- threshold 取 `production_targets[c].value` 的 ±10%（保守，避免误伤）\n\n**实施位置**: `src/models/binding_subproblem.py` 新增 `_load_overload_classification()`（读取 canonical_rules.json + mandatory_exact_instances.json）+ `_add_storage_box_overload_nogoods()`，在 `build()` 内、`_add_search_guidance()` 之前调用。\n\n**CP-SAT 形式**:\n\n```python\n# 对每个 wireless_sink 实例（即 protocol_storage_box，见 POSE_OPTIONAL_OPERATION_BY_TEMPLATE map）\nfor instance_id, inst in self.instances_by_id.items():\n    if str(inst.get(\"operation_type\")) != \"wireless_sink\":\n        continue\n    # 获取该实例所有 input slot 的 commodity vars\n    slot_ids = [s[\"slot_id\"] for s in self.generic_input_slots if s[\"instance_id\"] == instance_id]\n    for c_high in HIGH_PROD_LOW_DEMAND:\n        for c_low in LOW_PROD_HIGH_DEMAND:\n            # nogood: 不可同箱有 c_high 槽 == 1 AND c_low 槽 == 1\n            high_lits = [self.generic_input_vars[s][c_high] for s in slot_ids if c_high in self.generic_input_vars[s]]\n            low_lits = [self.generic_input_vars[s][c_low] for s in slot_ids if c_low in self.generic_input_vars[s]]\n            if not high_lits or not low_lits:\n                continue\n            for h in high_lits:\n                for l in low_lits:\n                    self.model.add_bool_or([h.Not(), l.Not()])  # NOT (h AND l)\n```\n\n**软化（可选）**: 真正\"软\"需要 reify + 罚项进 objective，但 binding 子问题没有 objective（只判可行性 + AddExactlyOne）。改为**硬 nogood + 失败时 fallback** 模式：另起一个 attribute `self._overload_separation_enabled = True`，FEASIBLE 失败时 caller 关闭它重跑（类似 fallback ladder，已经在 outer_search 有先例）。\n\n**风险**: **RISKY**。**这是硬 nogood，不是 hint**。如果 storage box 数量不足以分离高/低组，会切除合法解 → 影响 max_lex 目标（min_side 可能下降）。**必须配 fallback**：先开启跑一遍 → INFEASIBLE 时关闭重跑 → 二次 INFEASIBLE 才真判 INFEASIBLE。**对 max_lex 影响 = 可能 -**（如果 fallback 没接好），配 fallback 后 = 0/+。\n\n**工时**: 2-3 小时（分类计算 + nogood 生成 + fallback ladder + 单测 + 一轮 binding 回归）。**这条建议先做 shadow-only 实验**（`_overload_separation_enabled=False` 默认，env flag 开启），不直接进 certified path。\n\n---\n\n## Hint 3 — `compact_block_aspect_prior` (candidate ordering)\n\n**数学语义**: outer_search 候选枚举顺序里，对 `(area, w, h)` 候选，\"接近正方形 + 高密度\"优先。aspect ratio = max(w,h)/min(w,h)，越接近 1 越好；density 直接复用 `_frontier_selection_sort_key` 已有 `selection_score_num/den`。\n\n**实施位置**: `src/search/outer_search.py:229` `_candidate_sort_key()` —— 这个 key 控制 `generate_candidate_sizes()` 排序（line 220 `candidates.sort(key=_candidate_sort_key)`）。\n\n**当前代码**（已读，line 229-235）:\n```python\ndef _candidate_sort_key(candidate):\n    area, ghost_w, ghost_h = candidate\n    min_side = min(int(ghost_w), int(ghost_h))\n    max_side = max(int(ghost_w), int(ghost_h))\n    return (-int(area), -int(min_side), -int(max_side), -int(int(ghost_w)))\n```\n\n**改动**：在 `(-area, -min_side)` 之后、`-max_side` 之前插入 aspect tiebreak。`area` 和 `min_side` 仍然主导（保 max_lex 真值），仅在二者并列时偏好正方形。\n\n```python\ndef _candidate_sort_key(candidate):\n    area, ghost_w, ghost_h = candidate\n    min_side = min(int(ghost_w), int(ghost_h))\n    max_side = max(int(ghost_w), int(ghost_h))\n    # aspect penalty: smaller is better. max_side - min_side in [0, max_w-min_side].\n    aspect_penalty = max_side - min_side  # 0 = square, larger = more elongated\n    return (-int(area), -int(min_side), int(aspect_penalty), -int(max_side), -int(ghost_w))\n```\n\n注意：`aspect_penalty` 已经隐含在 `-min_side, -max_side` 里（同 area 同 min_side 时 max_side 越小越方），但不显式。**审计**：原 key `(-area, -min_side, -max_side, -w)` 在 `min_side` tied 时取 `max_side` 大的优先（→ 长条优先），**与玩家 hint 反向**。改成 `aspect_penalty` 升序（小的优先）= max_side 升序 = 正方形优先。\n\n**density 部分**：`generate_candidate_sizes` 在 outer_search 入口阶段没有 density 数据（mandatory instances 还没分配进 box），只能在 `_frontier_selection_sort_key`（line 357）里加。但那个 key 已经第一项是 `selection_score`（density-like），所以 **density 已经覆盖了**，此 hint 仅需改 candidate 主排序。\n\n**风险**: **SAFE**。tiebreak 仅在 `(area, min_side)` 严格相等时生效，**对 max_lex 主目标 = 0 影响**。**对 wall-time 影响 = +**（玩家共识\"正方形 + 高密度\"早期 wave 更易撞 incumbent，加速 Benders 收敛）。**符合 AI Safety Contract `order_only` 范畴**，不写 checkpoint，不动 ghost rectangle exterior path / proof schemas。\n\n**工时**: 20 分钟（改 4 行 + 改单测 fixture）。\n\n---\n\n## 综合风险对照\n\n| Hint | API 验证 | 类型 | max_lex 影响 | 工时 |\n|------|---------|------|------------|------|\n| 1 bridge_hop_le_2 | `add_hint` 实测通过 | hint (软) | 0 | 30 min |\n| 2 storage_overload | `add_bool_or(.Not())` 实测通过 | nogood (硬，需 fallback) | 0/+ 配 fallback；- 不配 | 2-3 hr |\n| 3 compact_aspect | tuple 排序，纯 Python | ordering (软) | 0 | 20 min |\n\n## P1 #9 verdict\n\n**2 条 SAFE，1 条 RISKY**\n\n- Hint 1 (bridge_hop) — SAFE\n- Hint 2 (storage_overload) — RISKY（硬 nogood，需 fallback ladder；shadow-only 起步）\n- Hint 3 (compact_aspect) — SAFE\n\n**实施顺序**：3 → 1 → 2\n\n理由：\n1. Hint 3 工时最短、改动最小、风险最低，先落地拿基线对比\n2. Hint 1 不动主目标语义，只改 routing 子问题 hint，对外表现温和\n3. Hint 2 必须配 fallback ladder + shadow-only env flag，最后做，且需要单独的 PROJECT_LOCK note（虽然不是 schema 改动，但 nogood 影响 binding 可行性边界，建议加到 acceleration_tuning_ai_plan.md 的 lane B 实验记录）\n\n**总工时**: 3-4 小时（含回归测试 + 单测 stub）。\n\n**审计自查**：本蓝图已规避前 9 处坑——`add_hint` 形参顺序确认 `(var, value)`，`add_bool_or` 接受 `Not()` literals，`AddDecisionStrategy` 已是项目内已用形式（binding_subproblem.py:390），数据模型 `(facility_type, operation_type, instance_id)` 与 `mandatory_exact_instances.json` 实测一致，recipes dict-of-dict 结构已确认（不是 list，前面已踩过这个坑）。无 enforce-wrap on AddMinEquality 之类的非法 API 调用。"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":566,"cache_read_input_tokens":66807,"output_tokens":4744,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":566},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":4744,"cache_read_input_tokens":66807,"cache_creation_input_tokens":566,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":566,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"}},"requestId":"req_011CapGTL4PoZiLgMZqyrL6x","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"0e00e57d-420f-44d9-98b9-033ccb89bc78","timestamp":"2026-05-08T01:55:01.440Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
